#title: Portamical_Core_TestDataLayers
#direction: down

#.found: fill=#ffcccc title=center,bold
#.core: fill=#ffffcc title=center,bold 
#.marker: fill=#ccffff title=center,bold 
#.spec: fill=#ccffcc title=center,bold 


[<found>1. Identity Layer
||
INamedCase ← Semantic identification & deduplication
 |
 Purpose: Equality, deduplication, test case naming
 ]
 
[<core>2. Core Abstraction Layer
||
ITestData ← Non-generic contract for framework adapters
 |
 Purpose: Reflection-based, dynamically typed handling]
 
[<marker>3. Pattern Markers Layer
||
IExpected<T> ← Expected outcome categorization
 |
 Purpose: Semantic specialization
 - IReturns<TStruct> → Return-value assertions
 - IThrows<TException> → Exception assertions]
 
[<spec>4. Specialization Layer
||
Concrete DTOs ← Fully typed implementations
with compile-time type safety
 |
 - TestData<T1..T9> (general test data)
 - TestDataReturns<TStruct, T1..T9> (return-value tests)
 - TestDataThrows<TException, T1..T9> (exception tests)
]

[
